# ── Firebase Credentials & Environment Secrets (Never Commit) ──────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
# App Check debug tokens are secrets and must never be committed
**/firebase-appcheck.json

